      "settings": {
        "title": "Our Mission",
        "desc": "Our Mission\nWe aim to simplify and enhance how people connect, ensuring every interaction leaves a lasting impression. By integrating cutting-edge NFC technology with sustainable practices, we strive to make networking smart, seamless, and environmentally friendly.",
